	mcpService.RegisterRoutes(echoServer)
```

**API v1** (`server/router/api/v1/v1.go:64-145`):

- gRPC-Gateway REST: `gwGroup.Any("/api/v1/*", ...)` and `gwGroup.Any("/file/*", ...)` (lines 128–129)
- Connect RPC: `connectGroup.Any("/memos.api.v1.*", ...)` (line 144)
- SSE: `RegisterSSERoutes` → `GET /api/v1/sse` (`sse_handler.go:25-29`)

**Other public surfaces:**

| Path | File:lines |
|------|-------------|
| `/attachments/:uid/:filename`, `/users/:identifier/avatar` | `server/router/fileserver/fileserver.go:121-124` |
